{"id":"6408ad949910b0f7","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-prop-cayley-transform.md","title":"Cayley Transform","display":"prop-cayley-transform — Cayley Transform","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-cayley-transform","aliases":["58-prop-cayley-transform"],"display":"prop-cayley-transform — Cayley Transform","depends_on":["[[58-df-self-adjoint]]","[[58-df-unitary]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-cayley-transform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-cayley-transform</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-cayley-transform — Cayley Transform"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5998e080b5d378a0\" href=\"?note=5998e080b5d378a0\" title=\"58-df-self-adjoint\">58-df-self-adjoint</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bcf5e4a644e3e929\" href=\"?note=bcf5e4a644e3e929\" title=\"58-df-unitary\">58-df-unitary</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,I_H,A,U,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V\">\\(H,I_H,A,U,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SelfAdjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SelfAdjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Unitary}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Unitary}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cayley\\text{-}transform} \\vdash \\mathrm{SelfAdjoint}_S(A,H)\\to\\exists!U\\;\\left(U=(A-iI_H)(A+iI_H)^{-1}\\land\\mathrm{Unitary}_S(U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\ker(I_H-U)=\\{0\\}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(A)=\\operatorname{ran}(I_H-U)\\land A=i(I_H+U)(I_H-U)^{-1}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cayley\\text{-}transform} \\vdash \\mathrm{SelfAdjoint}_S(A,H)\\to\\exists!U\\;\\left(U=(A-iI_H)(A+iI_H)^{-1}\\land\\mathrm{Unitary}_S(U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\ker(I_H-U)=\\{0\\}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(A)=\\operatorname{ran}(I_H-U)\\land A=i(I_H+U)(I_H-U)^{-1}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The recovery formula is interpreted on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(I_H-U)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(I_H-U)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_H-U\">\\(I_H-U\\)</span> need not have a bounded everywhere-defined inverse.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-self-adjoint","status":"resolved","id":"5998e080b5d378a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-self-adjoint]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-unitary","status":"resolved","id":"bcf5e4a644e3e929","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-unitary]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,I_H,A,U,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SelfAdjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Unitary}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cayley\\text{-}transform} \\vdash \\mathrm{SelfAdjoint}_S(A,H)\\to\\exists!U\\;\\left(U=(A-iI_H)(A+iI_H)^{-1}\\land\\mathrm{Unitary}_S(U,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\ker(I_H-U)=\\{0\\}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(A)=\\operatorname{ran}(I_H-U)\\land A=i(I_H+U)(I_H-U)^{-1}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(I_H-U)","display":false},{"tex":"I_H-U","display":false}],"bytes":904,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3939","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-prop-cayley-transform.md|58-prop-cayley-transform]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["5998e080b5d378a0","bcf5e4a644e3e929"]}